experiments/002-living-map/meshy/src/codex-notes.md:45:Generate B2 a SQUARE 1:1 studio Meshy source image. Reference 1 courtyard is material truth. A SINGLE RECTANGULAR FOUR-STOREY building 38m long,17m deep,14m high. Count floors bottom to top: floor0 glazed ground, floor1 windows, floor2 windows, floor3 windows, then flat roof. THREE separate horizontal rows of upper windows required. Buff-grey linear brick-slip stone cladding horizontal bands, deep regular window recesses, pale timber soffit above glazed ground. Flat sedum roof with six PV panels in 2x3 central array. View BACK-RIGHT corner, long rear face on left of image, short right end on right. Equal plan-axis foreshortening, 28 degree elevated camera, moderate lens low perspective. Proper 38:17:14 proportions, long side2.235 times depth, depth1.214 times height. Whole building centered only 80% image width, ground edge fully visible sharply defined. Seamless plain light grey background. Even overcast lighting subtle contact shadow only. No people trees cars landscaping other buildings sky base furniture text labels watermark. Building alone.
