+| Honey mass timber | `#C49A65` | `#6D5038` | Expressed posts and floor edges with real depth |
+| Pale stone or concrete | `#C7B79A` | `#817562` | Calm annexes, parapets and occasional bands |
+| Reflective glazing | `#687A75` | `#263B3B` | Opaque dark reflection, not transparent black holes |
+| Bronze trim and plinth | `#665747` | `#302C27` | A restrained secondary line |
+| PV glass | `#17242E` | `#101820` | Sparse glint `#91A4AB`, never cyan |
