+    "revealDepthImpression": "Strong. Approximately 180 to 250 mm on masonry homes and 300 to 450 mm behind the expressed timber frame on blocks.",
+    "rhythm": "One opening per dwelling bay, party-wall breaks and a legible floor band. Avoid a uniform office grid on the homes."
+  },
