+      "modellingAction": "Generate only the principal connected SuDS routes, widen them to a minimum readable 1.5 m and give classified water sky reflection with reed-darkened edges.",
+      "system": "scripts/golden_valley_2045.py, ground shader in future.js and water treatment in life.js",
